<title>ROMANIA: Tremor rocks eastern Romania, no damage reported.</title>
<headline>Tremor rocks eastern Romania, no damage reported.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>An earthquake measuring 5.0 on the open-ended Richter scale shook Romania's eastern Vrancea region on Saturday evening, the country's Earth Physics Institute said.</p>
<p>It said the tremor, which struck at 2126 (1926 GMT) at a depth of 115 km below ground level, was slightly felt in the capital Bucharest but there were no reports of damage.</p>
